Oh, but they do, though the buckets are perhaps a tiny bit smaller.  From 
stat-343.txt and hppw-343.txt:

Barbs use d10 HD.  Valks and Samurai use d8.

Humans get +d2 HP/level.  Orcs get +1.  Dwarves get +d3.

Each levelup, there is a bonus based on CON: 
15-16 : +1
   17 : +2
   18 : +3
   19+: +4

All three classes usually start with 18 CON; Sam are the least likely to 
have less.  Valks can start with 19+ if they are dwarves, but it is not 
likely (unless one startscums).

For comparison, Arcs start with around 12 CON.


